title: "Does Hierarchy Help? A Controlled Comparison of Cascaded, Flat and Label-Correlation Models for Multi-Label Retinal Fundus Disease Classification"
abstract: "Code, harmonization rules and released test-set predictions for a controlled comparison of a three-stage gated cascade, a flat classifier and a label-correlation transformer decoder on a unified 39-target retinal fundus label space built from RFMiD 1.0, RFMiD 2.0 and ODIR-5K."
